# Every way the engine pays a non-mana cost today, on a cast and on an activation.
# Sacrifice: itself (Bloodstained Mire, Mishra's Bauble), another permanent as an activation cost
# (Goblin Bombardment), as a flashback cost (Cabal Therapy) and as an alternative cost (Fireblast).
cost:SACRIFICE.self
cost:SACRIFICE
category:SACRIFICE_PERMANENT
# Discard: itself from hand (Faerie Macabre), the hand (Lion's Eye Diamond).
cost:DISCARD.self
cost:DISCARD.hand
# Life: a fixed cost (Bloodstained Mire; Snuff Out's alternative cost), an announced X (Toxic
# Deluge), a Phyrexian pip (Dismember).
cost:LIFE
cost:LIFE.x
cost:LIFE.phyrexian
category:CHOOSE_X
# How the spells were cast: an alternative cost (Fireblast, Snuff Out), flashback, the plain cast.
cast:alt_cost
cast:flashback
cast:hand
# The rest of an ordinary payment.
cost:TAP
cost:MANA
